Hi,
 
Thanks to Waldo Bastian (Intel/OSDL) for passing on this important
news for the Linux and UNIX open printing environment!
 
The Artifex Ghostscript versus CUPS ESP Ghostscript fork has been
a difficulty for better open printing support for some time - perhaps 
these forks can now be harmonized.
 
Please take a few moments to read Raph's posting referenced in
Waldo's note below.
 
Cheers,
- Ira
 

