Subject: [Desktop_printing] Ghostscript leading edge is now GPL!



Some nice news on the ghostscript front. Ghostscript used to have a staged
release process where new releases where first released under the AFPL and
only after a year under the GPL. This approach led to a fork by people who
needed to get patches in the GPL version. It's great to see that this has
been resolved.

